{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# TypeII TeXConversion Unit Tests\n\nUnit tests for TeXConversion of TypeII theory fields:\n- Linear dilaton (dPhi, dPhit)\n- Superghosts (xi, xit, eta, etat)\n- Exponential phi (expPhif, expPhib, expPhitf, expPhitb)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Needs[\"StringCode`\"]\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"TypeII\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\"-> \"TypeII-Xi\", \"bracket\"->\"Flat\"|>]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Î±pValue::shdw: \n   Symbol Î±pValue appears in multiple contexts \n    {StringCode`Conventions`TypeII`, StringCode`Conventions`Bosonic`}\n    ; definitions in context StringCode`Conventions`TypeII`\n     may shadow or be shadowed by other definitions.</pre>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "\"Î±pValue::shdw: \\n   Symbol Î±pValue appears in multiple contexts \\n    {StringCode`Conventions`TypeII`, StringCode`Conventions`Bosonic`}\\n    ; definitions in context StringCode`Conventions`TypeII`\\n     may shadow or be shadowed by other definitions.\"",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
