  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Linear Dilaton Tests\n\nNote: dPhi[n, z] has n+1 derivatives (offset by 1 since dPhi already has one derivative)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 1: dPhi with zero additional derivatives\n\ndPhi[0, 0] -> \"\\partial \\phi\" (one derivative total)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test1 = ToTeX[d\\[Phi][0, 0]];\nexpected1 = \"\\\\partial \\\\phi\";\ntest1Result = test1 === expected1;\nPrint[\"Test 1 (dPhi[0,0]): \", If[test1Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED - got \" <> test1]];\ntest1Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
